    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash brutal justice as <strong>Night Jackal</strong>, a masked vigilante driven to the edge after a violent assault on his manor leaves his world shattered. All signs point to his arch-nemesis, the elusive Burt the Barbarous\u2014but is there a <i>deeper conspiracy</i> afoot? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in Easy FPS Editor, this bite-sized boomer shooter throws you into a retro-fueled rampage of precision firepower, relentless enemies, and a protagonist hell-bent on settling his <strong>blood debt</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brains Meet Bullets:</strong> Balance raw gunplay with stealth, puzzles, underwater mechanics, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Mayhem:</strong> Experience this <strong>original story</strong> of a super hero coming unhinged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Artwork:</strong> Featuring visuals pulled from the Night Jackal comic, including work by industry veteran <strong>Derec Donovan</strong> (<i>Spider-Man, Superman, Wonder Woman</i>). </p>",
